  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_4123.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La madrugada de este viernes a s&aacute;bado ha habido un concierto de roch dentro de la fiesta de A&iacute;n, en el polideportivo, en plena Sierra Espad&aacute;n, con The Autan Plus Band, desde Onda, y Bocadillo de sal, oli i pebre roig, con alegres indumentarias desde Betx&iacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4114.jpg\" alt=\"img_4114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4115.jpg\" alt=\"img_4115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4116.jpg\" alt=\"img_4116\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4117.jpg\" alt=\"img_4117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4118.jpg\" alt=\"img_4118\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4119.jpg\" alt=\"img_4119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4121.jpg\" alt=\"img_4121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4122.jpg\" alt=\"img_4122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrockfestesaintheautan/img_4123.jpg\" alt=\"img_4123\" style=\"max-width:100%;he